---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="About Santi Solis | LGBTQ+ Tulum Guide | Queerness Experiences" description={"Meet Santi Solis (they/them): queer, trans and Mexican-born, in Tulum since 2017. Former UCLA wildlife biologist and founder of Queerness Experiences."}>

<section class="guide about-hero" id="about" style="border-top:none;position:relative;overflow:hidden;">
  <div class="shape-y"></div>
  <div class="shape-t"></div>
  <div class="guide-inner" style="position:relative;z-index:2;">
    <p class="sec-eye" style="color:var(--yellow);position:relative;z-index:2;">About</p>
    <h1>I'm Santi.<br>Nice to meet you.</h1>
    <p class="guide-lead">Queer, nonbinary, Mexican, and a Tulum local since 2017. I create travel experiences for queer, trans, and nonbinary people, rooted in the places and people that actually make this town special. My pronouns are they/them.</p>
    <div class="hero-grid" style="width:100%;max-width:520px;">
      <img src="/images/santi-hero-tulum.jpg" alt="Santi laughing in the water near Tulum, wearing a life vest">
      <img src="/images/santi-iglta-guadalajara.jpg" alt="Santi speaking on a panel at the IGLTA LGBTQ+ Travel Symposium in Guadalajara">
      <img src="/images/santi-pattie-gonia-scholarship.jpg" alt="Santi hugging a drag queen in the mountains, from the Pattie Gonia Queer Outdoor Expedition scholarship">
      <img src="/images/santi-market-ucla.jpg" alt="Santi laughing with a friend at a local market in Tulum">
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about-hero .shape-y{height:15%;}
  .about-hero h1{-webkit-text-stroke:1.5px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);paint-order:stroke fill;max-width:640px;position:relative;z-index:2;}
  .about-hero .guide-lead,.about-hero .guide-photo{position:relative;z-index:2;}
  .about-hero .guide-lead{font-size:20px;}
  .story-photo-landscape{width:100%;aspect-ratio:16/9;object-fit:cover;border:3px solid var(--dark);box-shadow:6px 6px 0 var(--yellow);margin-bottom:var(--s-md);}
  .about-creds.creds{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;max-width:820px;margin:0 auto;}
  .about-creds .cred .ct{font-size:15px;}
  .about-creds .cred .cd{font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.5;}
  .about-creds .cred{padding:14px;}
  .about-meet{font-family:var(--ff);font-size:26px;line-height:1.15;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--magenta);text-align:center;margin:0;}
</style>

<section class="creds about-creds" aria-label="Credentials" style="background:var(--bone);padding:var(--s-md) var(--s-sm) var(--s-lg);">
  <div class="cred"><div class="cnum">01</div><div><div class="ct">Former UCLA Wildlife Biologist</div><div class="cd">I studied marmots. The science behind every nature-based tour.</div></div></div>
  <div class="cred"><div class="cnum">02</div><div><div class="ct">IGLTA Conference Panelist</div><div class="cd">Invited by IGLTA to speak on a panel about creating queer experiences, at an event put together by the Guadalajara Tourism Board.</div></div></div>
  <div class="cred"><div class="cnum">03</div><div><div class="ct">Women's Day Speaker &amp; MC</div><div class="cd">Led a talk to 300+ women across Latin America on expanding their comfort zones, and served as master of ceremonies for Women's Day in Tulum.</div></div></div>
  <div class="cred"><div class="cnum">04</div><div><div class="ct">Committee Member, LADLE</div><div class="cd">Los Amigos de la Esquina. Started as an original volunteer, later general manager, now on committee.</div></div></div>
</section>

<section style="background:var(--white);padding:var(--s-sm) var(--s-sm) 0;text-align:center;">
  <p style="max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--muted);">I also work with other queer and trans travel agencies, helping them create experiences that prioritize small businesses and connection with locals. <a href="/work-with-me" style="color:var(--magenta);font-weight:700;">See how we could work together →</a></p>
</section>

<section style="background:var(--white);padding:var(--s-md) var(--s-sm) var(--s-md);max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;">
  <p class="sec-eye">My story</p>
  <div class="post-two-col">
    <div>
      <img class="post-photo" src="/images/santi-dog-lagoon.jpg" alt="Santi sitting with a dog on a dock over the lagoon in Tulum" style="aspect-ratio:1/1;object-position:center 55%;">
      <p class="story-caption">This is Charlie Christopher Darwin Solis Guerra. My other dog, Spoon, doesn't like to be photographed.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <ul class="story-list">
        <li><strong>Born in Chiapas</strong><span>The Mexican state that borders Guatemala. My family is from Mexico City.</span></li>
        <li><strong>Moved to New York, raised in LA</strong><span>We moved to New York when I was three, then to LA when I was four.</span></li>
        <li><strong>Wildlife biologist</strong><span>I worked for a UCLA research lab based in the Rocky Mountains.</span></li>
        <li><strong>Tulum since 2017</strong><span>The original plan was to be here for only three months.</span></li>
        <li><strong>Now</strong><span>I create travel experiences for queer, trans, and nonbinary people, rooted in the local places and people that make Tulum special.</span></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="post-two-col post-two-col-reverse">
    <div>
      <img class="post-photo" src="/images/santi-birding-binoculars.jpg" alt="Santi holding binoculars while birding in the jungle near Tulum" style="aspect-ratio:5/4;object-position:center 14%;">
    </div>
    <div>
      <p class="story-h">Outside of tours</p>
      <div class="story-chips">
        <span class="story-chip">Part of a local theater group</span>
        <span class="story-chip">Take go-go dancing classes</span>
        <a class="story-chip story-chip-link" href="https://instagram.com/ladle.mx" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Committee member, LADLE ↗</a>
      </div>
      <p class="story-note">LADLE (Los Amigos de la Esquina) is a local nonprofit offering art, wellbeing, and life-skills programs for Mayan and local Mexican kids. I started as a volunteer, became general manager, and now help guide it from the committee.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="about-close">
  <div class="about-close-inner">
    <img class="about-close-photo" src="/images/santi-cave-cenote-mask.jpg" alt="Santi grinning in a snorkel mask inside a cenote cave near Tulum">
    <div class="about-close-text">
      <p class="about-meet">I'm excited to meet you!</p>
      <a href="/tours" class="btn-p" style="display:block;text-align:center;">See the Tours →</a>
      <a href="/blog/queer-tulum-recommendations" class="btn-p" style="display:block;text-align:center;">Free Tulum Guide →</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .story-list{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;}
  .story-list li{border-left:4px solid var(--magenta);background:var(--bone);padding:10px 14px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;}
  .story-list strong{font-family:var(--ff);font-size:15px;line-height:1.2;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:400;color:var(--dark);}
  .story-list span{font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--dark);}
  .story-caption{font-family:var(--fb);font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:var(--magenta);line-height:1.4;margin:10px 0 0;}
  .story-h{font-family:var(--ff);font-size:20px;line-height:1.1;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--dark);margin:0 0 10px;}
  .story-chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-bottom:var(--s-sm);}
  .story-chip{border:2px solid var(--dark);border-radius:999px;padding:6px 14px;font-family:var(--fb);font-size:14px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3;}
  .story-chip-link{color:var(--magenta);border-color:var(--magenta);}
  .story-note{font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--muted);margin:0;}
  .about-close{background:var(--magenta);padding:var(--s-md) var(--s-sm);}
  .about-close-inner{max-width:820px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:var(--s-sm);}
  .about-close-photo{flex:0 0 44%;width:44%;aspect-ratio:3/4;object-fit:cover;border:3px solid var(--dark);box-shadow:5px 5px 0 var(--yellow);}
  .about-close-text{flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;min-width:0;}
  .about-close .about-meet{color:var(--white);text-align:left;font-size:24px;margin:0 0 4px;}
  @media(max-width:719px){.about-close-inner{flex-direction:column;align-items:stretch;gap:var(--s-md);}.about-close-photo{flex:none;width:72%;max-width:300px;align-self:center;}.about-close-text{width:100%;}.about-close .about-meet{text-align:center;font-size:28px;margin:0;}}
  @media(min-width:720px){.about-close{padding:var(--s-lg) 40px;}.about-close-photo{flex-basis:300px;width:300px;}.about-close .about-meet{font-size:34px;}.about-close-inner{gap:var(--s-lg);}}
</style>

</Layout>
